      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A material or physical output created or produced as a result of a project or an endeavour such as a research investigation. Examples include a building constructed as a result of a building project, and research outputs such as a cell line, a mouse mutant or a new form of microscope."
      }
    ],
